## 1. Interactive Visual Schema Mapping Architecture

The **Visual Mapping Component** is the central interactive feature where users review, customize, and approve AI-generated database mappings.

```
┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                                INTERACTIVE SCHEMA MAPPER                               │
├────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│                                                                                        │
│  SOURCE (MongoDB: "users")         MAPPING CONTROLS        TARGET (PostgreSQL: "users")│
│  ─────────────────────────         ────────────────        ─────────────────────────── │
│  [✓] _id (ObjectId)             ───[ 1:1 ID ]─────────►    id          [BIGSERIAL PK ▼]│
│  [✓] name (String)              ───[ Direct ]─────────►    name        [VARCHAR(255) ▼]│
│  [✓] email (String, 98%)        ───[ Nullable ]───────►    email       [VARCHAR(255) ▼]│
│  [✓] address.city (String)      ───[ Flattened ]──────►    city        [VARCHAR(100) ▼]│
│  [✓] address.zip (String)       ───[ Flattened ]──────►    pincode     [VARCHAR(10)  ▼]│
│  [✓] createdAt (Date)           ───[ UTC Cast ]───────►    created_at  [TIMESTAMPTZ  ▼]│
│  [ ] legacyNotes (String)       ───[ Excluded ✕ ]─────►    (Skipped)                   │
│                                                                                        │
│  SOURCE (MongoDB: "orders")                                TARGET (PostgreSQL: "orders")│
│  ──────────────────────────                                ────────────────────────────│
│  [✓] _id (ObjectId)             ───[ 1:1 ID ]─────────►    id          [BIGSERIAL PK ▼]│
│  [✓] userId (ObjectId)          ───[ Foreign Key ]────►    user_id     [INT -> users ▼]│
│  [✓] items (Array<Object>)      ───[ 1:N Split ]──────►    ► Creates "order_items" table│
│                                                                                        │
└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

### Key UI Features:
1. **Interactive Dropdowns:** Change target data types on the fly (e.g. swap `VARCHAR(255)` to `TEXT` or `JSONB`).
2. **Field Exclusion Toggles:** Uncheck unnecessary or legacy fields to skip them during migration.
3. **Special Badges:** Visual indicators for `[⚠️ Flattened Object]`, `[🔗 Extracted 1:N Table]`, and `[🤖 AI Confidence: High]`.

