## 3. 8-Step Wizard Navigation State Machine

```
[1. Direction] ──► [2. Source DB] ──► [3. Target DB] ──► [4. AI Mapping]
                                                              │
[8. Done/Report] ◄── [7. Execution] ◄── [6. Dry Run] ◄── [5. Risk Report]
```

* **State Persistence:** Wizard state is preserved in client state so users can navigate backwards and forwards to refine mappings without losing input.
* **Syntax Highlighted Previews:** Monospace code editors with one-click **Copy Script**, **Download .sql / .js**, and **Run Dry Run**.
